<size:22><b>Business Decisions</b></size>
<color:gray>Key business rules, policies, and decisions</color>
Invitations are single use and expire
A patient cannot link themselves
A link starts inactive until consent is granted
Consent is always revocable, with no justification
A revoked link is kept with its revocation date
A discharged link is never reactivated
Acknowledging targets does not change the plan
}
